{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-11-18 06:00:00', 'title': 'PG&E CORPORATION APPOINTS PATRICIA K. POPPE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 4, 2021', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PG&E CORPORATION (NYSE: PCG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF PATRICIA K. “PATTI” POPPE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND MEMBER OF ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AS WELL AS OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY. MS. POPPE CURRENTLY SERVES AS PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF CMS ENERGY CORPORATION AND ITS PRINCIPAL SUBSIDIARY, CONSUMERS ENERGY COMPANY, AN INVESTOR-OWNED UTILITY THAT PROVIDES ELECTRICITY AND NATURAL GAS TO 6.7 MILLION MI'}